你的手探进口袋深处，摸向装着蠕虫的圆铁盒；你的手指紧紧攥住它，而这一攥，指尖又碰到了一张纸。{VOICE: "The worms" should be delivered ominously, faintly disgustedly. The worms are the MPC's addiction; he craves and loathes them}

