他停下脚步，脸涨得更红，随后匆忙地打了个手势，补充道：“可影子想落在哪里，就落在哪里；想怎么落，就怎么落。”{VOICE: "But shadows fall . . . as they will." This is a kind of catechism-type line, delivered by rote and note entirely believingly. Note that line has a deliberate staccato structure designed to run slightly at odds with the "hastily" - it emphasizes how the Memorialist is a bit thrown off, nervous, jangled.}

卡拉加特·安沃尔。塔巴特。影子。它们在你意识的边缘掠过，从你的把握中溜走。但那些蠕虫……它们却近在咫尺。{VOICE: Now when the narrator says "worms" the disgust is largely gone: I hear this almost a little huskily, anticipating their pleasure. However, the "they are well within reach" could have a more ominous sound.}

